abstract: "A numbered, in-repo, plain-text work ledger for concurrent AI coding sessions - file it, claim it, close it on the record. One number per matter for life, claims before work, closures that cite commits, and six mechanical checks (duplicates, phantom citations, merge-driver safety, claim collisions, pending IDs, silent reopens)."
